As the shutter retainer 73d rotates, the first arm 73d1 thereof clamps the vertical face of the guide rail 34YG of the cap 34Y. Then, while engaging the projection 34dlbl of the engaging portion 34d1b, the second arm 73d2 faces and contacts the side wall of the shutter body 34d1 where the base end of the engaging portion 34d1b is situated. Thus, the second arm 73d2 clamps the side wall.
