Referring to FIG. 6, supply of toner from the container mount 70 is described below.
The different color toners contained in the respective developer containers 32Y, 32M, 35 32C, and 32K in the container mount 70 are supplied to the corresponding developing devices 5Y, 5M, 5C, and 5K by the developer replenishing devices 60Y, 60M, 60C, and 60K (only the developer replenishing device 60Y is illustrated in FIG. 6) according to the amount of the corresponding toner consumed.
